sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant LIS as Legacy HIS<br/>(Hospital's existing system)
    participant IGW as Inbound Gateway<br/>(Integration Hub)
    participant Map as Mapping / Translation<br/>Engine
    participant Pharm as Pharmacy Module
    participant PEP as PEP Middleware
    participant Cerbos as Cerbos PDP<br/>(sidecar)
    participant DB as Pharmacy Database
    participant Bus as Event Bus

    Note over LIS,Bus: Hospital runs Pharmacy module only — legacy HIS handles OPD, IPD, Lab

    LIS->>IGW: HL7v2 OMP (pharmacy order)<br/>via mTLS
    Note over IGW: Authenticate (mTLS cert)<br/>Validate HL7v2 format<br/>Rate-limit check

    IGW->>Map: Route to mapping engine

    Map->>Map: Translate HL7v2 OMP →<br/>internal PrescriptionOrder event
    Note over Map: Map legacy drug codes →<br/>platform drug catalog IDs<br/>Map legacy patient MRN →<br/>EMPI ID (via lookup)

    Map->>Pharm: POST /pharmacy/orders<br/>(service-account JWT)

    Pharm->>PEP: Intercept request
    PEP->>Cerbos: CheckResources (loopback gRPC)
    Note over PEP,Cerbos: Principal: {legacy_his, kind: partner}<br/>Resource: {kind: pharmacy:order}<br/>Action: create

    Cerbos-->>PEP: EFFECT_ALLOW

    PEP->>Pharm: Proceed

    Pharm->>DB: Create prescription order<br/>(iq_tenant_id, EMPI ID, drugs)
    DB-->>Pharm: Order saved

    Pharm->>Bus: Publish order.created event

    Pharm-->>IGW: 201 Created (order ID)
    IGW-->>LIS: HL7v2 ACK
